{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "mmc-agent-workflow-tokens",
  "title": "Claude Code Agent Workflow - Token & Cost Usage (MysteryMixClub-ysu2)",
  "description": "Meta-tooling observability for the repo's own multi-agent Claude Code workflow. Not MMC app observability (see MysteryMixClub-p0qzz0).",
  "tags": [
    "claude-code",
    "agent-workflow",
    "mmc-meta"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "source",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "source",
        "query": "live,backfill,live|backfill",
        "current": {
          "text": "live|backfill",
          "value": "live|backfill"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "live",
            "value": "live",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "backfill",
            "value": "backfill",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "live + backfill",
            "value": "live|backfill",
            "selected": true
          }
        ],
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Meta-tooling, not app observability.** This measures what the repo's own Claude Code multi-agent workflow (developer/tester/reviewer/ui-agent/product-manager subagents) costs in tokens -- separate from MysteryMixClub-p0qzz0 (the app's own runtime observability). Use the `source` variable above to compare `live` (real-time OTel) vs `backfill` (one-time reconstruction from `~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl`) data. **Caveat:** per Claude Code's OTel docs, `agent.name` is only emitted verbatim for built-in agent types or agents installed from an official marketplace plugin. MMC's five subagents are project-local custom agents (`.claude/agents/*.md`), so **live** telemetry will report them collapsed under `agent_name=\"custom\"` rather than individually -- the per-agent breakdown below is fully granular for `backfill` data (reconstructed from transcripts, where the real subagent identity is known) but coarse for `live` data until/unless the agents are published as a marketplace plugin. See observability/README.md."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pipe health",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "claude_code.session.count (by source)",
      "description": "Acceptance criterion: confirms the OTel -> Prometheus pipe works. Should be > 0 once telemetry env vars are set on the host and at least one Claude Code session has started, and/or after the backfill script has been run. Uses last_over_time() over the dashboard range rather than an instant vector, because backfilled series only have historical samples and would otherwise fall outside Prometheus's 5m staleness window at 'now'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (source) (last_over_time({__name__=~\"claude_code_session_count.*\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape target health (live pipe)",
      "description": "1 = Prometheus is successfully scraping Claude Code's OTel Prometheus exporter at host.docker.internal:9464/metrics. 0 or no data = telemetry env vars are not set on the host, or no Claude Code session is currently running (the exporter is only up while a session is active).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"claude-code-agent-workflow\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Distinct sources loaded",
      "description": "Sanity check: expect 2 once both live telemetry and the one-time backfill have run at least once (live, backfill).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (source) (last_over_time({__name__=~\"claude_code_token_usage.*\"}[$__range])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Core metric: tokens per PR, by agent, cache hit ratio",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens per PR (overall)",
      "description": "sum(claude_code.token.usage) / sum(claude_code.pull_request.count), the ticket's core metric. NOTE: claude_code.pull_request.count carries no agent.name attribute upstream in Claude Code's OTel emitter, so this ratio cannot itself be sliced by agent -- see the adjacent per-agent token panel for that half of the picture.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase({__name__=~\"claude_code_token_usage.*\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(increase({__name__=~\"claude_code_pull_request_count.*\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "tokens / PR"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Token usage by agent.name",
      "description": "Per-subagent token attribution. See the caveat in the top panel: live data currently buckets MMC's custom subagents under agent_name=\"custom\"; backfill data is fully granular (developer/tester/reviewer/ui-agent/uiux-designer/devops/main/etc, derived from transcript agent metadata).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 60
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (agent_name) (increase({__name__=~\"claude_code_token_usage.*\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Token usage by type (input / output / cacheRead / cacheCreation)",
      "description": "Cache hit ratio is the most important lever here: a high cacheRead share relative to input+cacheCreation means prompt caching is working and cost is well controlled.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 60
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (type) (increase({__name__=~\"claude_code_token_usage.*\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cache hit ratio",
      "description": "cacheRead tokens / (cacheRead + cacheCreation + input) tokens. The single lever most likely to move cost per the ticket -- invisible in aggregate token totals, which is why it gets its own panel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mmc-agent-obs-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase({__name__=~\"claude_code_token_usage.*\", type=\"cacheRead\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(increase({__name__=~\"claude_code_token_usage.*\", type=~\"cacheRead|cacheCreation|input\", source=~\"$source\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Secondary: cost, commits, lines of code, active time",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
